//? Title: Pratt evaluation: actual binding decisions and completed operations
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
A binding comparison decides whether the next operator belongs to the current
expression or to its caller. The native evaluator now records those comparisons
and the values actually computed during recursive evaluation. The tiny example
1+2*3 makes the multiplication finish before the addition. The original
precedence and right-associative power examples remain; no abstract syntax tree
or second parser reconstructs their histories.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

$$ \text{descend iff }\operatorname{lbp}(op)>\operatorname{min\_bp};\qquad\operatorname{rbp}(\wedge)=29<30=\operatorname{lbp}(\wedge). $$

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/pratt_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");

    auto t = a::pratt_trace("1+2*3");
    std::vector<a::PrattEvent> operations;
    std::print("\n| actual operator offset | operator | actual left | actual right | actual result |\n| " "---: | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (auto &e : t.events)
        if (e.kind == a::PrattEventKind::Infix) {
            operations.push_back(e);
    std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", e.offset, e.op, e.lhs, e.rhs,
               e.value);
        }

        g::Diagram d;
        d.node("n0", {0, 0},
               std::format("Actual first completed infix\nbyte {}: {} * {} = {}",
                           operations[0].offset, operations[0].lhs,
                           operations[0].rhs, operations[0].value));
        d.node("n1", {10, 0},
               std::format("Actual second completed infix\nbyte {}: {} + {} = {}",
                           operations[1].offset, operations[1].lhs,
                           operations[1].rhs, operations[1].value));
        d.node("n2", {20, 0},
               std::format("Actual returned scalar\n{}", t.run.value));
        d.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
        d.save_svg("build/pratt_tiny.svg");
}
```
